 ∆ProcessLinkOptions←{
⍝ Runs `ProcessLinkOptions` for the project folder ⍺, with ⍵ as the -watch= setting (0 = not specified).
⍝ The project config carries a LINK section with forceFilenames←1 and watch←'none'. Neither is a Link
⍝ default, so the result tells whether the LINK section got passed on to Link.
⍝ Returns (linkOptions watch): the options that would be passed to Link, and the resulting parms.watch.
     json←'{ CIDER: { source: "APLSource" }, LINK: { forceFilenames: 1, watch: "none" } }'
     config←⎕JSON⍠('Dialect' 'JSON5')⊣json
     parms←##.Cider.CreateOpenParms ⍬
     parms.(folder batch watch)←⍺ 1 ⍵
     (linkOptions parms)←##.Cider.ProcessLinkOptions parms config
     linkOptions parms.watch
 }
